lum Undergraduate General Education Policies How to Apply Steps to Apply Dates and Deadlines Visit Virtual Tour Graduate Student Tours Plan Your Visit Request Information Meet Your Counselor After Admission Orientation Orientation Steps Placement Tests Youth & Pre-College Programs Cost of Attendance Net Price Calculator Reduced Tuition for Out of State Students Financial Aid Apply for Financial Aid Accept Your Aid Manage Your Aid Scholarships Apply for Scholarships Manage & Renew Your Scholarship Manage External Scholarships Loans Federal Loans Health Professions Loans Private Loans Short-Term Loans Grants IU Indianapolis Pledge Federal Pell Federal Supplemental Frank O’Bannon Child of Disabled Veteran National Guard Supplemental Work-Study Pay Your Bill Make a Payment Deposits and Prepayments Receive Your Refund Tax Information Tuition Disputes Participate in Research Opportunities for Undergraduate Students Opportunities for Graduate Students Volunteer for a Research Study Research Initiatives Community Engaged Research Centers & Institutes IU Indianapolis Faculty Academic Advising Schedule an Appointment Academic Support & Tutoring Libraries Educational Success Programs Groups Student Support Services Career Services & Jobs Explore Careers Fall Career Week Health & Wellness Technology & Tools Recruit IU Indy Students Athletics and Recreation Student Organizations Events Housing Dining IUPUI Transition to IU Indianapolis IU Indianapolis Leadership Meet IU Indianapolis Leadership Chancellor Updates Request an Appearance State of the Campus Campus Initiatives History Strategic Plan Goals Honors and Awards Chancellor’s Medallion Student Awards Visit Apply Home Cost & Financial Aid Pay Your Bill Deposits and Prepayments Student prepayment deposits IU Indianapolis has four online portals for payments related to the specific programs listed here. Dental student prepayments Prospective dental students at IU Indianapolis may make a prepayment for either the International Dental Program (IDP) or the Doctor of Dental Surgery (DDS) programs. If you have questions about either program, please contact Stacy Brown at (317) 274-8173 or dsadmit@iu.edu . Pay your dental program deposit Lilly Family School of Philanthropy PhilD program Students admitted to the Professional Doctorate in Philanthropic Leadership program (PhilD) at IU Indianapolis may make a nonrefundable prepayment to reserve their space in the program. If you have questions about the program, please send your inquiry to PhilD@iu.edu. Make your PhilD program deposit MBA prepayment deposits Thes links are intended for prospective students at Indianapolis or Columbus who wish to make a prepayment deposit for one of the programs listed. If you have specific questions about these degree programs, please contact the appropriate program office. Prepayment Deposit Information Program Contact Evening MBA: IU Indianapolis Kelley School of Business (317) 274-4895 or mbaindy@iu.edu Physician MBA: IU Indianapolis Kelley School of Business (317) 274-3855 or kbizmed@iu.edu IU MBA: IU Columbus (317) 274-3855 or kbizmed@iu.edu Make your MBA program deposit Study abroad prepayment deposits This link is for enrolled students who are paying a deposit for an upcoming study abroad program managed through the Indianapolis campus. If you have questions about a study abroad program, please contact the Study Abroad Office at (317) 274-2081. Make your study abroad deposit IU Indianapolis Office of the Bursar Payment Mailing PO Box 6020 Indianapolis , IN 46206 USA Indianapolis Office of the Bursar Payment Help Campus Center Suite 250 (do not mail payments directly to this address) Hours Monday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Tuesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Wednesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Thursday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Indianapolis Office of the Bursar Phone & Email Help Hours Monday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Tuesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Wednesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Thursday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday: 9:30 a.m. - 5 p.m. +1-317-274-2451 iuindy.bursar@iu.edu Social media links x facebook instagram youtube linkedin Accessibility College Scorecard Open to All Privacy Notice Required disclosures Copyright © The Trustees of Indiana University"
