 your vision forward. Get started Build your alumni network, find career fairs, and more. Explore career events Find career services by school Jobs for students Earn while you learn Find part-time jobs, on-campus internships, work-study opportunities, and more. Find jobs on Handshake Log in to our career services platform for students and alumni. Discover and innovate Undergraduate and graduate students can participate in groundbreaking research happening across campus. Career services Attend Fall Career Week Discover all the career paths open to you, search for jobs, network with employers, and more. Land an internship Take what you’re learning in the classroom into the real world and gain additional practical skills. Explore career options Discover career pathways that match your interests and start gaining experience right away. Search successfully Build your resume and prepare for interviews with these resources. Get hands-on, real-world experience See how you can go from the classroom to your career, from research to your capstone project. Find resources to support your career From career assessments to tips for using virtual reality to prepare for interviews, we have you covered. IU Indianapolis Campus Career and Advising Services Taylor Hall 815 W Michigan St Indianapolis , IN 46202 USA ccas@iu.edu IU Indianapolis Office of Student Employment University Tower, Suite 202 911 W North St Indianapolis , IN 46202 USA Hours Monday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Tuesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Wednesday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Thursday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. +1-317-274-0857 future@iu.edu Social media links x facebook instagram youtube linkedin Accessibility College Scorecard Open to All Privacy Notice Required disclosures Copyright © The Trustees of Indiana University"
